{"type":"assistant","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done. Two changes in `repo/cache.py`:\n\n1. **Fixed the off-by-one**: `is_expired` used `age > ttl`, so an entry at exactly its TTL was still treated as fresh. The docstring (and the test asserting `is_expired(60, 60) is True`) say `age == ttl` is expired, so it's now `age >= ttl`.\n2. **Removed `old_ttl_check`**: it was a legacy v1 wrapper that just forwarded to `is_expired`, and nothing in the repo or tests references it.\n\n`repo/rows.py`'s `cache_summary` calls `is_expired` directly, so it picks up the fix automatically — no changes needed there. Tests pass (2/2).\n\nI left the other TODOs alone (`dedupe_rows` O(n²), `cache_summary` recomputation, `format_row` padding) since they're performance/style notes, not correctness bugs — happy to tackle those too if you want."}]},"session_id":"7dd33993-d4bd-4893-896d-948329c798b3"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","duration_ms":43433,"duration_api_ms":43433,"is_error":false,"result":"Found it. The bug is in `is_expired`: the docstring says an entry at exactly `age == ttl` is expired, but the code uses strict `>`, so entries live one tick too long. There's also a dead legacy wrapper `old_ttl_check` that nothing uses.Done. Two changes in `repo/cache.py`:\n\n1. **Fixed the off-by-one**: `is_expired` used `age > ttl`, so an entry at exactly its TTL was still treated as fresh. The docstring (and the test asserting `is_expired(60, 60) is True`) say `age == ttl` is expired, so it's now `age >= ttl`.\n2. **Removed `old_ttl_check`**: it was a legacy v1 wrapper that just forwarded to `is_expired`, and nothing in the repo or tests references it.\n\n`repo/rows.py`'s `cache_summary` calls `is_expired` directly, so it picks up the fix automatically — no changes needed there. Tests pass (2/2).\n\nI left the other TODOs alone (`dedupe_rows` O(n²), `cache_summary` recomputation, `format_row` padding) since they're performance/style notes, not correctness bugs — happy to tackle those too if you want.","session_id":"7dd33993-d4bd-4893-896d-948329c798b3","request_id":"6a917361-89be-4775-8aaf-738c245c9633","usage":{"inputTokens":13982,"outputTokens":1457,"cacheReadTokens":63372,"cacheWriteTokens":0}}
